      "title": "Ghost of Conviction New DEMO Is Available Now!",
      "date": "2023-10-25 02:27:33",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5229301621571421928",
      "content": "[b]Hi everybody,\nThanks to your advices and suggestions for the last DEMO, we performed a comprehensive optimization of the game. You can play the BRAND NEW DEMO right now!\n[/b]\n\nV0.6.6.9\n\nMajor Updates\n1.DEMO version of the story simplified;\n2. Complete replacement of character drawing, new school uniform drawing;\n3. Optimization of part of the story copy;\n4. Change the CV of Tianchen Zhan character, and replace the corresponding dubbing of some characters according to the copy modification;\n5. Sharpness or texture optimization of some character drawing, background picture, FG, CG;\n6. Several performance improvements;\n7. Improve the performance of the main menu of the game and the corridor gameplay;\n8. Corridor gameplay UI adjustment;\n9. Add DEMO special transitional text performance effect;\n10. Added a skip option for the performance of the text at the beginning of the chapter and the performance of the transitional text;\n11. Read files and mute when death returns to checkpoint;\n12. Modify incorrect characters\n\nOther Updates\n1. Dialog box HD;\n2. Select UI font size; \n3. Font changes in some menus, historical review, map UI in the upper left corner of gameplay, etc.;\n4. Add auto-save point prompt;\n5. Fix some gameplay bugs;\n6. Select Suspension effect from the main menu and add flicker effect; \n\nIf you have any questions about the game, please join the official QQ group: 127843809. \n"
    }
